      ":question/id": "35206e11-edac-5a7b-9d18-1be9a096d720",
      ":question/problem": "Without using a calculator, find the exact value of\n\n$$\n6\\sin\\left(\\frac{135}{2}^{\\circ}\\right)\\cos\\left(\\frac{135}{2}^{\\circ}\\right)\n$$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Use the double-angle formula for sine and keep the multiplier.\n\nSet $x=\\frac{135}{2}^{\\circ}$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\sin x\\cos x &=\\sin(2x) \\\\ &=\\sin\\left(135^{\\circ}\\right) \\\\ &=\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstitute this exact value:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}6\\sin\\left(\\frac{135}{2}^{\\circ}\\right)\\cos\\left(\\frac{135}{2}^{\\circ}\\right)&=3\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right) \\\\ &=\\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
